A16_SMSS_72_M016936_016                                                       
                                                                              
Apollo 16 Soil Mechanics                                                      
Lunar Self-Recording Penetrometer (LSRP) Page B-2                             
                                                                              
Apollo 16 Load Calibration Curve                                              
                                                                              
This handwritten plot gives the drum circumferential deflection in            
millimeters (abscissa) versus the load in Newtons (ordinate).  The solid      
line shows the result of loading the penetrometer and measuring the           
resultant drum deflection.  The parallel dotted line above it shows the       
addition of the 3.49 Newton correction for the penetrometer weight on         
the Moon from A16_SMSS_72_M016936_015, page B-1.                              
